{"time": 1761917844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1425603959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1033334080", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "一张小床放在这个客房的一个角落，对面有一张桌子和摇摇晃晃的木椅子，北面的一扇门半开着，露出楼上房间的一个小盥洗室。"}
{"time": 1761917849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2083411611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1033334080", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "给全体奶回去"}
